Q1. DISTINCT
Display all the unique department names in the table.
SELECT DISTINCT Department
FROM Employees;

Q2. WHERE with comparison
Display the names and salaries of employees earning more than ₹35,000.
SELECT Name, Salary
FROM Employees
WHERE Salary>35000;

Q3. ORDER BY Display all employees in order of salary, from highest to lowest.
SELECT Name
FROM Employees
ORDER BY Salary DESC;

Q4. COUNT() Find the total number of employees in the table.
SELECT COUNT(*)
FROM Employees;

